WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.834
-Senator Lindsey Graham
has used

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.434
multiple Fox News appearances

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:06.200
to beg viewers
to send their money

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.167
to billionaire criminal
defendant Donald Trump,

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.300
while Marjorie Taylor Greene
insulted New York City,

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.901
but none of that
is working politically.

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:13.567
Republicans discovered,
yet again, this week,

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:16.100
that tying their fates to Trump,
who still faces

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.334
even more looming indictments,
has been a disaster.

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:20.400
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.534
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:26.434
We've said this many times
on the show,

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:28.667
and it remains true today --
Donald Trump is deeply unpopular

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:30.067
with the broad majority
of Americans.

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.601
Even in his moment of need,
after he sent out a call

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:33.934
to his supporters
to protest and...

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.701
...the response was
mostly shrugs.

00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:39.067
Only a small number
of Trump supporters

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:41.567
[ Laughter ]
showed up at the courthouse,
where they looked like tourists

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:44.067
who had wandered over
from the M&amp;M store.

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:46.667
[ New York accent ]
I'm here to support Donald Trump

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:49.801
and to see if the green M&amp;M
is still sexy.

00:00:49.801 --> 00:00:52.067
[ Laughter and applause ]
And single.

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.367
[ Laughter ]
I'm sorry, but this is not
a protest.

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:56.934
This isn't even the dinner rush
at Cracker Barrel.

00:00:56.934 --> 00:00:58.334
[ Laughter and applause ]
So,

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:00.133
Trump is and has always been
very unpopular,

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:01.701
but sometimes it's just hard
to remember that

00:01:01.701 --> 00:01:04.400
because he looms so large
over our politics

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.434
and because one
of our two major parties

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:07.601
remains totally devoted
to him.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:08.868
Case in point --

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.701
Senator Lindsey Graham,
who once said of Trump,

00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:12.701
"Count me out,
enough is enough,"

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:14.501
has been going on Fox News
for a week,

00:01:14.501 --> 00:01:15.801
on the verge of tears,

00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:17.234
begging viewers to send money

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.267
to self-proclaimed billionaire
Donald Trump

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:20.534
for his legal defense fund.

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:22.567
-To those who are
listening tonight,

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:24.200
if you believe Donald Trump

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.834
is being treated poorly
and wrongly,

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:28.100
stand up and help the man.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.400
Pray for our country.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.367
Pray for him.

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:32.667
Go to donaldjtrump.com

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:35.367
and give money,
so he can defend himselves.

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.534
[ Laughter ]
America literally is at stake.

00:01:37.534 --> 00:01:38.300
As we know it.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.901
Is at stake as we know it.

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.601
I'm sorry I'm so upset,

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.501
[ Laughter ]
but please help President Trump.

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:45.634
If you can afford 5 or 10 bucks.

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:48.200
If you can't afford $1, fine,
just pray,

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.267
[ Laughter ]
Pray for this country.

00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:50.501
Pray for this president.

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:53.434
And, if you got any money
to give, give it.

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:54.868
Lindseygraham.com.

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:56.300
It doesn't go to me.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.467
It goes to helping
this president.

00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:01.167
[ Laughter ]
-I think Lindsey Graham
might've missed his calling

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:03.234
as a televangelist because
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:03.234 --> 00:02:05.334
he's got the most important
part down.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:07.033
"God --
in this case, Donald Trump --

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:09.400
needs more money,
but you can send it to me

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.367
and I'll make sure he gets it."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:11.367 --> 00:02:12.734
[ As Graham ]
I mean, I might invest it

00:02:12.734 --> 00:02:15.300
in some side projects,
get a little Bitcoin.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:19.501
My skin crawls,
hearing Lindsey Graham ask

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:20.834
for 5 or 10 bucks

00:02:20.834 --> 00:02:23.834
for a self-proclaimed
billionaire's legal fees.

00:02:23.834 --> 00:02:26.000
[ As Graham ]
For less than the price
of a cup of coffee a day,

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.033
you can keep this man
where he belongs --

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:30.501
in the window seat
of his own private plane

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:32.634
and knee deep
in adult film stars.

00:02:32.634 --> 00:02:34.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:36.367
It's what Jesus would've wanted.

00:02:36.367 --> 00:02:39.868
[ Cheering ]
Also, what the hell --

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:41.734
what the hell is going on
with Graham's appearance here?

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:43.267
Did Fox News
just light him weird

00:02:43.267 --> 00:02:45.467
or is he starting to turn
into Trump's Mini-Me?

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:46.901
[ Laughter ]
Next time Lindsey sees Trump,

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:48.601
he's going to have circles
under his eyes,

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.934
wearing a baggy suit
and oversized tie.

00:02:50.934 --> 00:02:52.634
[ As Graham ]
See, Donald? I'm just like you.

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:53.934
[ Laughter ]
What's that, Meemaw?

00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:55.601
I am just like him!

00:02:55.601 --> 00:02:56.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:56.501 --> 00:02:57.801
I got the suit, the tie.

00:02:57.801 --> 00:02:59.567
What do you mean,
I lack his charisma?

00:02:59.567 --> 00:03:02.200
I got more charisma
in my little finger

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.601
than you have
in your whole CPAP machine!

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:06.267
[ Laughter ]
What?!

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:08.434
Well, if you can't hear me,
turn it off!

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:10.767
Whirring all night long,
keeping me up.

00:03:10.767 --> 00:03:12.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.033 --> 00:03:13.701
Keeping the dogs up.

00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:16.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:17.534
This is --

00:03:17.534 --> 00:03:19.300
You just saw previews
for a Broadway show.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:20.968 --> 00:03:23.234
For free, I should note.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.234 --> 00:03:25.100
So, the GOP remains
fully devoted to Trump,

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.968
but it's been a political
disaster for them,

00:03:26.968 --> 00:03:28.367
as we learned, yet again,
this week.

00:03:28.367 --> 00:03:31.601
They got crushed in the 2018
midterms, the 2020 election,

00:03:31.601 --> 00:03:33.734
they underperformed
in the 2022 midterms,

00:03:33.734 --> 00:03:35.601
and they lost
the Georgia runoffs.

00:03:35.601 --> 00:03:37.868
The progressive just won
the Chicago mayor's race,

00:03:37.868 --> 00:03:40.133
[ Cheering and applause ]
despite the GOP's -- yeah --

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:43.067
despite the GOP's constant
scaremongering about crime.

00:03:43.067 --> 00:03:45.033
And, in Wisconsin,
a crucial swing state,

00:03:45.033 --> 00:03:47.234
Democrats scored a massive
11-point victory

00:03:47.234 --> 00:03:48.567
in a race
for the state Supreme Court

00:03:48.567 --> 00:03:50.400
that gave progressives control
of the court

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.200
[ Cheering and applause ]
for the first time in 15 years,

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.901
which could decide the fate
of abortion protections

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:56.067
and gerrymandering
in Wisconsin.

00:03:56.067 --> 00:03:57.667
I'm no political expert,
but it seems like

00:03:57.667 --> 00:04:00.868
the GOP's strategy, of whining
about wokeness, voter fraud,

00:04:00.868 --> 00:04:02.501
and gender neutral
Potato Head dolls

00:04:02.501 --> 00:04:04.000
[ Laughter ]
is just not exactly working,

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.534
especially since their senators
are starting to look

00:04:06.534 --> 00:04:08.234
a little bit
like Potato Head dolls.

00:04:08.234 --> 00:04:09.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:09.634 --> 00:04:11.267
Yet, they just can't
stop themselves.

00:04:11.267 --> 00:04:13.234
The crazies are still going
on Fox, whining

00:04:13.234 --> 00:04:15.400
about the same old bull[bleep]
they always whine about

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.901
and coming off
as deeply unlikable.

00:04:16.901 --> 00:04:17.934
Like Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:19.300
who showed up
in Manhattan Tuesday

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:22.100
to scream into a bullhorn,
in her Unabomber glasses,

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.968
[ Laughter ]
before fleeing

00:04:23.968 --> 00:04:25.767
with a police escort back
to her Escalade,

00:04:25.767 --> 00:04:28.834
like a Disney mascot
whose fake head just fell off.

00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:30.334
[ Laughter ]
"Look away, kids!

00:04:30.334 --> 00:04:32.400
Goofy is fine! He's fine!
He's just going to go

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.234
to the hospital for a minute.
Move, move!"

00:04:35.701 --> 00:04:37.567
Greene then went
on Tucker Carlson's show
last night

00:04:37.567 --> 00:04:39.667
to say a bunch of insulting
things about the city.

00:04:39.667 --> 00:04:42.100
-Mayor Adams described
New York as his "home."

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.100
How did his home look,
pretty neat and tidy?

00:04:45.701 --> 00:04:48.133
-No, his home is disgusting.

00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:50.601
[ Laughter ]
I compared it to what I call
Gotham City.

00:04:50.601 --> 00:04:52.167
[ Laughter ]
The streets are filthy.

00:04:52.167 --> 00:04:53.934
They're covered with people

00:04:53.934 --> 00:04:55.701
[ Laughter ]
basically dying on drugs.

00:04:55.701 --> 00:04:58.067
They can't even stand up.
They're falling over.

00:04:58.067 --> 00:04:59.534
There's so much crime
in the city,

00:04:59.534 --> 00:05:02.601
I can't comprehend
how people live there.

00:05:02.601 --> 00:05:05.033
It was repulsive.
It smells bad.

00:05:05.033 --> 00:05:07.834
[ Laughter ]
And I just -- I think
it's a terrible place.

00:05:07.834 --> 00:05:10.033
[ Laughter ]
-Okay, Bane's girlfriend.

00:05:10.033 --> 00:05:12.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.267
How dare you say that
in the city that is home

00:05:14.267 --> 00:05:16.100
to Fox News headquarters?!

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:17.133 --> 00:05:18.434
These people are such
ass[bleep].

00:05:18.434 --> 00:05:20.334
[ Laughter and applause ]
Only Republicans

00:05:20.334 --> 00:05:21.934
would go to liberal cities
and [bleep] on them.

00:05:21.934 --> 00:05:23.400
It doesn't work
the other way around.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.834
I don't go to her hometown
and say nasty things about it,

00:05:25.834 --> 00:05:27.734
although I don't know
where she's from.

00:05:27.734 --> 00:05:29.901
I'm assuming the videotape
from "The Ring." Is that --

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:31.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:31.868 --> 00:05:33.133
Is that a place people grow up?

00:05:33.133 --> 00:05:34.834
Do they got good schools there?

00:05:34.834 --> 00:05:38.234
[ Laughter ]
The only people who are allowed
to [bleep] on New York --

00:05:38.234 --> 00:05:39.234
the only people! --

00:05:39.234 --> 00:05:40.901
are New Yorkers!

00:05:40.901 --> 00:05:42.868
[ Cheering and applause ]
Because we love it

00:05:42.868 --> 00:05:44.501
and we love how mad it makes us.

00:05:44.501 --> 00:05:46.234
It's not an easy city
to live in.

00:05:46.234 --> 00:05:47.467
You fight and you claw

00:05:47.467 --> 00:05:49.067
and you finally get the job
of your dreams

00:05:49.067 --> 00:05:50.868
and you move
into a New York City apartment

00:05:50.868 --> 00:05:53.200
and you give a little fist pump
and you say, "Yes!"

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.334
And then your neighbor pounds
on the wall and screams --

00:05:55.334 --> 00:05:57.267
[ New York accent ]
Keep the [bleep] noise down!

00:05:57.267 --> 00:05:58.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:58.801 --> 00:06:00.534
And, yeah, sure,
as a New Yorker,

00:06:00.534 --> 00:06:02.767
I'm willing to admit
it smells bad here sometimes.

00:06:02.767 --> 00:06:04.400
I assume -- I had always assumed

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:06.934
that's why Tucker Carlson
was making that face.

00:06:06.934 --> 00:06:08.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:08.434 --> 00:06:11.434
Everyone who lives there makes
that face at least once a day.

00:06:11.434 --> 00:06:12.601
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.601 --> 00:06:13.801
And we're usually thinking
something like,

00:06:13.801 --> 00:06:16.400
"Is that urine
or boiled cabbage?"

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:20.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:20.367 --> 00:06:22.334
The point is none of this
[bleep] is working.

00:06:22.334 --> 00:06:24.167
They keep whining.
They keep losing.

00:06:24.167 --> 00:06:26.334
Their constant victimhood
and obsession with wokeness

00:06:26.334 --> 00:06:28.300
and devotion to Trump
just keeps turning people off.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.400
Republicans have tied
their political fortunes

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:31.767
to a guy who just got arrested

00:06:31.767 --> 00:06:34.033
and still faces the possibility
of even more arrests.

00:06:34.033 --> 00:06:35.868
Even amid his arraignment
in New York,

00:06:35.868 --> 00:06:38.467
there's been a constant stream
of breaking news about all

00:06:38.467 --> 00:06:40.634
the other criminal
investigations Trump is facing.

00:06:40.634 --> 00:06:42.067
-Donald Trump's arrest
and arraignment

00:06:42.067 --> 00:06:45.000
in New York City today is only
part of his legal trouble.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.100
The special counsel is still
investigating January 6th

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:50.033
and those classified documents;

00:06:50.033 --> 00:06:51.667
and prosecutors
in Fulton County, Georgia,

00:06:51.667 --> 00:06:53.167
are still considering charges.

00:06:53.167 --> 00:06:55.467
-Breaking news here --
a three-judge panel

00:06:55.467 --> 00:06:57.968
of the U.S. Court of Appeals
for the D.C. Circuit

00:06:57.968 --> 00:07:00.200
has denied
an emergency motion filed

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:02.834
by President Trump's
legal team yesterday,

00:07:02.834 --> 00:07:04.534
seeking to stop several
of his top aides,

00:07:04.534 --> 00:07:05.767
including Mark Meadows,

00:07:05.767 --> 00:07:07.868
from testifying
before the federal grand jury.

00:07:07.868 --> 00:07:09.934
-Breaking news report in one
of the special counsel

00:07:09.934 --> 00:07:11.534
investigations
into Donald Trump --

00:07:11.534 --> 00:07:15.534
former Vice President Mike Pence
will not fight a judge's order

00:07:15.534 --> 00:07:17.534
for him to testify
before a grand jury

00:07:17.534 --> 00:07:20.400
weighing Trump's efforts
to overturn the 2020 election.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.000
-The Washington Post reports
that federal investigators

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.701
have gathered
new evidence pointing

00:07:24.701 --> 00:07:26.834
to possible obstruction
by Donald Trump

00:07:26.834 --> 00:07:29.634
in the Mar-a-Lago
classified documents case.

00:07:29.634 --> 00:07:31.234
-Sources say Trump looked

00:07:31.234 --> 00:07:33.067
through boxes
of government records

00:07:33.067 --> 00:07:35.400
after he was subpoenaed
to return them.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:37.400
-There's so much nonstop
breaking news

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:38.767
about the Trump investigations

00:07:38.767 --> 00:07:40.367
that, if you wanted
to keep track of it all,

00:07:40.367 --> 00:07:42.334
you'd need
an entire show dedicated

00:07:42.334 --> 00:07:44.767
to scrutinizing every detail
and following every development.

00:07:44.767 --> 00:07:46.067
Oh, wait.
Oh, wait, that's us.

00:07:46.067 --> 00:07:48.000
[ Laughter and cheering ]
Okay, great. So, we have it.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.033
[ Applause ]
You know, when I first --

00:07:50.033 --> 00:07:51.934
You know, when I first pitched
the idea for this show,

00:07:51.934 --> 00:07:54.033
back in 2014,
the execs were all like,

00:07:54.033 --> 00:07:55.300
"Trump, the real estate guy?

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.734
But he hasn't committed
any crimes."

00:07:56.734 --> 00:07:58.667
And I just leaned back,
lit up a cigarette, and said,

00:07:58.667 --> 00:08:00.067
"Ohhh,

00:08:00.067 --> 00:08:02.467
[ Laughter ]
just you wait.

00:08:02.467 --> 00:08:03.601
Just you wait."

00:08:03.601 --> 00:08:05.901
And then, because I don't smoke,
I coughed a lot.

00:08:05.901 --> 00:08:08.701
[ Laughter and applause ]
All in all, I'd say it was
a pretty bad meeting.

00:08:08.701 --> 00:08:10.968
[ Laughter ]
The point is, the GOP has tied
itself to this guy

00:08:10.968 --> 00:08:13.167
and his legal troubles are not
going away anytime soon.

00:08:13.167 --> 00:08:15.400
In the classified documents
case, for example,

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:16.734
the special counsel
has amassed

00:08:16.734 --> 00:08:18.267
even more evidence
of obstruction

00:08:18.267 --> 00:08:21.934
and yet, Trump keeps admitting
to what he's been accused of --

00:08:21.934 --> 00:08:24.133
that he just rifled through
the classified documents,

00:08:24.133 --> 00:08:25.734
even after he was asked
to return them.

00:08:25.734 --> 00:08:27.834
In fact, at one point,
during a recent interview

00:08:27.834 --> 00:08:30.267
with his buddy Sean Hannity,
Trump blurted out the truth.

00:08:30.267 --> 00:08:33.667
-I can't imagine
you ever saying,

00:08:33.667 --> 00:08:34.901
"Bring me some of the boxes

00:08:34.901 --> 00:08:36.434
that we brought back
from the White House.

00:08:36.434 --> 00:08:38.033
I'd like to look at them."
Did you ever do that?

00:08:38.033 --> 00:08:39.567
-I would have the right
to do that.

00:08:39.567 --> 00:08:41.534
[ Laughter ]
There's nothing wrong with it.
-But I know you.

00:08:41.534 --> 00:08:42.467
I don't think you would do it.

00:08:42.467 --> 00:08:43.901
-Well, I don't have a lot
of time,

00:08:43.901 --> 00:08:45.801
but I would have the right
to do that.

00:08:45.801 --> 00:08:47.834
I would do that.
There'd be nothing wrong.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:49.601
[ Laughter and applause ]
Remember this...
-Yeah.

00:08:49.601 --> 00:08:52.467
-...this is the
Presidential Records Act.

00:08:52.467 --> 00:08:54.534
I have the right to take stuff.

00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:56.234
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Hannity --

00:08:56.234 --> 00:08:58.634
Hannity even tries to move on
and Trump is like --

00:08:58.634 --> 00:09:00.801
[ As Trump ]
No, wait, I'm not done
confessing, Sean.

00:09:00.801 --> 00:09:02.434
I have the right.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.434 --> 00:09:04.834
I have the right to take stuff,
be it classified documents

00:09:04.834 --> 00:09:06.300
or candy bars
at the checkout,

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.734
that I hide in what I call
my shoplifting coat.

00:09:08.734 --> 00:09:10.367
[ Laughter ]
"Alright.

00:09:10.367 --> 00:09:11.567
Alright, let's move on,
Mr. President.

00:09:11.567 --> 00:09:12.934
As Trump ]
Before we do, Sean, Zagnut?

00:09:12.934 --> 00:09:15.200
It's a little melted,
but it's still very delicious.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.667
Crunchy peanut butter --

00:09:17.667 --> 00:09:19.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:19.701 --> 00:09:21.534
Crunchy peanut butter
with coconut.

00:09:21.534 --> 00:09:23.834
We love a Zagnut, everybody.
It's very --

00:09:23.834 --> 00:09:25.300
It's a very modern candy bar.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.467
When Seth brought it up today
and the young writers,

00:09:27.467 --> 00:09:29.334
they said, "No one's going
to know Zagnut.

00:09:29.334 --> 00:09:31.067
[ Laughter and applause ]
They're not going to know it."

00:09:31.067 --> 00:09:32.834
And Seth said,
"Everybody knows Zagnut.

00:09:32.834 --> 00:09:34.334
You wait.
When we say Zagnut,

00:09:34.334 --> 00:09:36.000
there's going to be a big cheer
from the audience.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.133
[ Laughter and cheering ]

00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:39.767
And now, Seth --

00:09:39.767 --> 00:09:41.067
[ Applause ]
And now -- And I'll tell you

00:09:41.067 --> 00:09:42.234
what's happening right now.

00:09:42.234 --> 00:09:43.901
Seth's seeing the silhouette
of his writers

00:09:43.901 --> 00:09:45.634
and they're celebrating
how wrong he was

00:09:45.634 --> 00:09:47.601
[ Laughter ]
and it's very --
it's very hurtful

00:09:47.601 --> 00:09:49.868
that they would -- very,
very cruel that they'd do that.

00:09:49.868 --> 00:09:52.801
[ Laughter ]

00:09:52.801 --> 00:09:55.901
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:09:58.334 --> 00:10:00.300
Trump's only defense,
as far as I can tell,

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.334
is an incredibly bizarre claim
he keeps making,

00:10:02.334 --> 00:10:04.100
that the special counsel
in the investigation,

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.701
a guy named Jack Smith,
is using a fake name.

00:10:06.701 --> 00:10:09.868
-This lunatic special prosecutor
named Jack Smith.

00:10:09.868 --> 00:10:12.400
I wonder what it was prior
to a change.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:13.734
-I'm sorry, what, what?!

00:10:13.734 --> 00:10:15.901
[ Laughter ]
Why do you think
he changed his name?

00:10:15.901 --> 00:10:17.534
Are you suggesting
something illicit,

00:10:17.534 --> 00:10:20.634
or are you genuinely curious
about how to do it?

00:10:20.634 --> 00:10:23.634
[ Laughter ]
Are you trying to pull
a Don Draper yourself

00:10:23.634 --> 00:10:25.701
and just swap identities
with a different person?

00:10:25.701 --> 00:10:27.100
[ As Trump ]
I wonder how he changed
his name

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:29.200
because, if you could change
your name and dye your hair,

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.801
you might be able to flee
all your legal troubles

00:10:31.801 --> 00:10:34.834
[ Laughter ]
and start a new life in a small
village in South America,

00:10:34.834 --> 00:10:36.634
where people only know you
by your new identity --

00:10:36.634 --> 00:10:38.200
Mr. Lindsey Graham.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.467
[ Laughter, ohhs, and applause ]

00:10:39.467 --> 00:10:42.100
When you pull back
from the craziness of this week,

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:43.133
one thing is clear --

00:10:43.133 --> 00:10:45.367
Trumpism is a giant loser
for the GOP.

00:10:45.367 --> 00:10:46.834
It's not working,
people don't want it,

00:10:46.834 --> 00:10:48.000
and they keep making that clear

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.200
in election after election
after election,

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.567
yet Republicans won't give up.

00:10:50.567 --> 00:10:52.300
I have no idea what people
like Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.567
are thinking.
I can't get inside her head.

00:10:54.567 --> 00:10:56.467
Although, if I could,
I bet I would say it was...

00:10:56.467 --> 00:10:58.667
-Repulsive.
It smells bad.

00:10:58.667 --> 00:10:59.834
[ Laughter and applause ]
And I just -- I think

00:10:59.834 --> 00:11:01.667
it's a terrible place.

00:11:01.667 --> 00:11:03.434
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:03.434 --> 00:11:07.133
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

